1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,335
The Verge reports that Google removed an AI image editing feature from Google Earth only one day after launch.

2
00:00:08,285 --> 00:00:16,447
Online examples showed people using it to create realistic fake images, including refugees and bomb craters.

3
00:00:16,447 --> 00:00:25,005
The case shows why powerful AI tools need careful safeguards before they are added to widely used public platforms.

